nes on the market. Smart Current™ allows precise and convenient delivery of microcurrent using a “hands free” , app<br\/>controlled device which is customizable and allows you to use different<br\/>attachments. <\/p>"}},"question_dh9EMz":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What is a Waveform?","text":"<p>A waveform is the electrical property of microcurrent treatment delivered by machine.<br\/>Most of the microcurrent machines delivers square bi-phasic waveform. It provides smooth feeling and does not create irritation on the<br\/>skin. <\/p>"}},"question_zj8VKU":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What is the difference between Nuface, Foreo, Ziip, and QT?","text":"<p>Our device stands out amongst the others because not only can you use two waveforms<br\/>top stretch and lift facial muscles, but the Microamp levels go up to 400 we have attachments that you can use to switch up tour treatment. <\/p>"}},"question_C3YpiJ":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What type of results will I see?","text":"<p>Most of our users see results after their first treatment; however, results may<br\/>vary. We recommend taking before\/after photos and lifting half of your face to compare. Results are cumulative and optimal results are achieved with regular use. <\/p>"}},"question_byUT8V":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Does Microcurrent Contract Muscles?","text":"<p>No, microcurrent is a low-level current that gently and passively stimulates the muscles, working at the sensory level. It is normal to not feel any sensation during your treatment. A slight tingling<br\/>sensation may be felt in certain areas, due to the fact that facial sensitivity varies individually.<\/p>"}},"question_z4L7Q9":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Are there any additional costs or subscription fees?","text":"<p>The device is a one-time purchase that comes without any additional fees or charges. Enjoy the full functionality of your treatment without worrying about ongoing costs. <br